{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21755","headline":"乐府古题序 忆远曲 · 元稹","name":"乐府古题序 忆远曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆远曲，郎身不远郎心远。\n沙随郎饭俱在匙，郎意看沙那比饭。\n水中书字无字痕，君心暗画谁会君。\n况妾事姑姑进止，身去门前同万里。\n一家尽是郎腹心，妾似生来无两耳。\n妾身何足言，听妾私劝君。\n君今夜夜醉何处？姑来伴妾自闭门。\n嫁夫恨不早，养儿将备老。\n妾自嫁郎身骨立，老姑爲郎求娶妾。\n妾不忍见姑郎忍见，爲郎忍耐看姑面。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}